@startuml
title State Chart: Transfer (Online Fund Transfer through Net Banking)
[*] --> Initiated : submitTransferForm\n/ create Transfer record
Initiated : entry / validate beneficiary, amount, limit
Authenticated : entry / generate OTP
OtpPending : entry / send OTP, start 3 minute timer
Processing : entry / debit sender account
Processing : do / send credit to beneficiary bank
Completed : entry / send SMS and email, update statement
Failed : entry / release hold, notify customer
Reversed : entry / re-credit sender, notify customer

Initiated --> Authenticated : passwordVerified\n[beneficiary active,\namount within balance and limit]
Initiated --> Initiated : passwordWrong\n[attempts < 3] / show error
Initiated --> Failed : passwordWrong\n[attempts = 3]
Initiated --> Failed : validationFailed\n[beneficiary inactive\nor amount too high]
Authenticated --> OtpPending : otpGenerated\n/ send OTP, start timer
OtpPending --> Processing : otpEntered\n[OTP matches, timer running]
OtpPending --> OtpPending : otpEntered\n[OTP wrong, attempts < 3]\n/ show error
OtpPending --> OtpPending : resendOtp [resends < 3]\n/ new OTP, restart timer
OtpPending --> Failed : otpEntered\n[OTP wrong, attempts = 3]
OtpPending --> Failed : timeout
Processing --> Completed : creditConfirmed\n/ notify, update statement
Processing --> Failed : debitFailed
Processing --> Reversed : creditRejected\n/ re-credit sender
Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Reversed --> [*]
@enduml
